    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d803">

                <pb facs="0809" n="705" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg705"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/1073.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-02-12T12:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 12, 1913—noon</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Americans driven from their homes by the firing or by the occupation of their
                    homes by troops have thronged the Embassy this morning. I anticipate that their
                    number will increase and probably other nationalities will seek the Embassy’s
                    protection. As the sanitary conditions resulting from this would become
                    intolerable, I am distributing the larger number among adjoining houses,
                    allowing to remain here at night only those who can sleep in beds or on sofas.
                    Will the Department please advise me whether I am authorized to extend a general
                    supervision over and care for these people?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
